{"lang": "zh_TW", "eventid": "act51side", "eventName": "人們，我們", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "PA-1", "avgTag": "行動前", "storyName": "“卡托加區歡迎你”", "storyInfo": "在一年一度的冬季舞會上，娜塔莉婭見識到了形形色色的貴族，並獨自收集情報。在這些貴族為政治吵得不可開交時，前來抗議的學生們包圍了舞會廳。\n", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g7_ballroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.1, "fillto": 0.1, "fadetime": 0.1, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.1, "fillto": 0.1, "fadetime": 0.1, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.8, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 11, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一路走來，走廊上都只點著蠟燭。連皇宮也在節約用電嗎？這真是……", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為了將儲存的能源節省起來分給民眾，陛下是這樣說的。", "name": "殷勤的近侍"}}, {"id": 13, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過請您放心，這只是陛下出於勤儉節約的提議，宮中的生活並沒有受到影響，今年的冬季舞會也是如此。", "name": "殷勤的近侍"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我們就快到了。羅斯托娃小姐，請讓我為您取下大衣。", "name": "殷勤的近侍"}}, {"id": 15, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 1.0}}, {"id": 17, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.2}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_clothtrailground"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.8}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "感謝您的幫助。", "name": "早露"}}, {"id": 22, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "職責所在。", "name": "殷勤的近侍"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 24, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$ouat_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "focusout", "attributes": {"type": "bg", "id": "72_g7_ballroom", "from": 1.0, "to": 0.2, "duration": 4.0, "block": "false"}}, {"id": 26, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1", "duration": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 30, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好亮……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1"}, {"id": 31, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1982_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 32, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那麼，我就退下了。祝您愉快。", "name": "殷勤的近侍"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1982_1#1$1"}, {"id": 33, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "60,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.1}}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1", "posfrom": "-35,0", "posto": "35,0", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 38, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.1}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "煩請稍等，我還有一些問題——", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1"}, {"id": 40, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——娜塔申卡？", "name": "貴族女性"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 46, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯？您是……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#6$1"}, {"id": 47, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沃倫佐娃伯爵夫人？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#6$1"}, {"id": 48, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast"}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1", "posfrom": "-80,0", "posto": "110,0", "duration": 0.8}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "陛下在上……可憐的孩子，真的是你。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 54, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "稍遠處的貴婦人看見了早露，立即快步迎了上來，驚喜的神情幾乎讓她有失貴族儀態。"}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她緊緊握住了早露的前臂，像是在努力確認眼前的女孩並不是幻影。"}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "posfrom": "110,0", "posto": "20,0", "duration": 1.8}}, {"id": 59, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.8}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 61, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔申卡……實在是太好了，我還能見到你……健康活著的你。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我聽說了發生在切爾諾伯格的事情，我的心簡直都要碎了。我實在是不明白，命運為何要讓如此善良的一家人遭受這樣可怕的事……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "承蒙您的掛念，雖然損失了一些產業，但比起全家人的安危來說，那些已經不值一提了……總之，都過去了。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "對，沒錯，快點讓我們忘了那些不好的回憶吧……你不知道，我在收到你的信，得知你要來聖駿堡的時候有多高興。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真希望你能夠在這裡過上一段平靜的日子，但如你所見，現在的聖駿堡也不是一個安穩平靜的地方。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "到處都是心懷不滿的人，到處都是不知感恩的抱怨——彷彿那些無禮的軍人鬧得還不夠一樣，吵鬧的平民也恨不得將聖駿堡攪得天翻地覆。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 69, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#13$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 70, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#13$1"}, {"id": 71, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 72, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，不好意思。你剛回來，恐怕還不知道。為近來這些事，我終日精神緊繃，多夢少眠，但見到老朋友的孩子，也不該一上來就說這些。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 73, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#11$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 74, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……不會的，只要是您說的，我都願意聽。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#11$1"}, {"id": 75, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 76, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是個好孩子，但現在卻不是提這些事的好時候。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "告訴我，娜塔申卡。你母親身體還好嗎？你父親安德烈如今又在何處？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果他來了聖駿堡，卻未遣人告知於我，只讓你來參加冬季舞會……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想，應該是因為我們兩家已經疏遠太久，我實在不算是個合格的朋友。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是這樣的，沃倫佐娃夫人。父親曾說，如果能在這裡見到您，就讓我代他向您致意，請您寬恕他的久疏問候。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於母親那邊就更不必說了，您當然是她最要好的女性朋友，但羅斯托夫家族如今必須想辦法緊緊抓住中部僅剩的那些產業。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“我們切不可再丟失任何體面。”所以，非常遺憾……他們在短時間內都抽不出身。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#5$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我瞭解了。但是孩子，你最後應該說的是：“所以，我就在這裡了。”", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "看看你，已經是一個成熟體面的小姐了，可以代表羅斯托夫家族了，不是嗎？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我得說，你的儀態與教養，比許多土生土長的聖駿堡人都更為優秀——我相信過不了多久，聖駿堡會記住羅斯托夫這個姓氏的。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……我很清楚自己還有許多要學的事務。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 93, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "說起這點，夫人，其實我很想向您請教，關於聖駿堡現在的局勢……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1"}, {"id": 94, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "年輕的娜塔申卡，不要著急，我瞭解你的困惑，但這不是三言兩語就能說清楚的問題。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 96, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你要學會用自己的眼睛去看，不會有比現在更好的機會了，你現在最應該做的就是——先好好享受這場冬季舞會。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在陛下到來之前，拋開那些惱人的問題、急於知道的答案，以及所有關於未來將會如何的奇談怪論，只是享受當下。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "去舞蹈，去嬉笑，去做年輕人應當做的事。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你看上某位青年軍官，就算是那個老頑固博爾孔斯基家的，為了你母親，我也會豁出這張老臉去幫你說媒——", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "總之，在陛下的庇護下安寧地享樂，這是屬於首都，屬於我們這些忠誠的人的特權。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔申卡，你必須先學會這點，才能真正融入其中。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 102, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 103, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 0.0, "fillfrom": 0.1, "fillto": 0.01, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {"direction": 4.0, "fillfrom": 0.1, "fillto": 0.01, "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 105, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 107, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 108, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "curtain", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 112, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g2_sjbstreet_n", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 113, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 115, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$mist_intro", "key": "$mist_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 117, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.6, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 118, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$transmission", "volume": 0.8}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“……你必須先學會這點，才能真正融入其中。”", "multi": "true", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 120, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 122, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2156_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 124, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……礦工們仍在挨餓，哪怕是在聖駿堡，奧多耶夫區的居民也都已經用不起暖氣，卡托加區更是在停工之後，被徹底切斷了電力和暖氣供應。", "name": "真理"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2156_1#2$1"}, {"id": 125, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2156_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 126, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算這樣，他們也還是要享樂。", "name": "真理"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2156_1#2$1"}, {"id": 127, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#5$1"}}, {"id": 128, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不明白……那個人不是說，陛下節省了皇宮的用電嗎？那些省下來的能源呢？為什麼——", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#5$1"}, {"id": 129, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_194_leto_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 130, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "聊的這些都什麼亂七八糟的，“大人物”就是麻煩。", "name": "烈夏"}, "figure_art": "avg_194_leto_1#4$1"}, {"id": 131, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1"}}, {"id": 132, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "而且，早露姐一個人在裡面，真的沒關係嗎？", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1"}, {"id": 133, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2156_1#11$1"}}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "學生聯合大會召開的前幾天，娜塔莉婭就和我們商量過了，她會以羅斯托夫家繼承人的身分進入舞會，探查情報。", "name": "真理"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2156_1#11$1"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2156_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "畢竟，總有些東西是只有貴族才知道，而其他人全都被蒙在鼓裡的。無論是哪方面的情報，多掌握一些總沒錯。", "name": "真理"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2156_1#8$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2156_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "索尼婭相信她能做好，我也沒有反對的理由。除了這些我們早就有所預料的對話內容，目前聽起來還算順利，監聽設備的聲音也算清晰。", "name": "真理"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2156_1#8$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 141, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1", "style": "bg", "name": "bg_black", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 0.6, "duration": 2.0, "slot": "bgover", "layer": 1.0, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 142, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"maskid": "ui_cutin_mask_horizon", "char": "伯塔尼", "size": "1300,380", "style": 2.0, "offset": "0,20", "channel": 3.0, "isblock": "false"}}, {"id": 144, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 1.0, "slot": "m", "sfrom": "1.25,1.25", "sto": "1,1", "sduration": 0.3, "pfrom": "80,20", "pto": "0,20", "name": "cutin_char_23", "duration": 6.0, "isblock": "false"}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "type": 2.0, "name": "72_g3_podium", "sfrom": "1.25,1.25", "sto": "1.1,1.1", "sduration": 0.3, "pfrom": "100,20", "pto": "0,20", "duration": 5.0, "isblock": "false"}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "多虧那位叫“伯塔尼”的學生，她的設備比想像中可靠。", "name": "烈夏"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "interlude", "attributes": {"channel": 3.0, "clear": "true"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1", "style": "bg", "name": "bg_black", "afrom": 0.6, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.7, "slot": "bgover", "layer": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.7}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1"}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2156_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "接下來，我們只需要按照計劃配合示威行動就好。", "name": "真理"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2156_1#8$1"}, {"id": 155, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1"}}, {"id": 156, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "凜冬姐好像在那邊招手，我們該過去會合了！", "name": "古米"}, "figure_art": "avg_196_sunbr_1#9$1"}, {"id": 157, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2156_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 158, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "應該是她已經和其他人溝通好了。我們收拾一下，現在就過去。", "name": "真理"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2156_1#8$1"}, {"id": 159, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2156_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 160, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "烈夏，你是留在這裡還是？", "name": "真理"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2156_1#4$1"}, {"id": 161, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_194_leto_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，等一下，先別說話。", "name": "烈夏"}, "figure_art": "avg_194_leto_1#7$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_194_leto_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好像有情況……", "name": "烈夏"}, "figure_art": "avg_194_leto_1#7$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 166, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 167, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 169, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g7_ballroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$ouat_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 175, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我還以為，今年的冬季舞會不會舉辦了……", "name": "擔憂的貴族"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那群無禮的叛臣，竟敢憑仗著武力威脅我們的皇帝陛下。但我也實在不知道，我們的陛下到底該拿他們怎麼辦才好……", "name": "擔憂的貴族"}}, {"id": 177, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "越是這種時刻，我們越要挺起胸膛，繼續必要的活動。陛下有這樣的勇氣，也有這樣的遠見。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因為這是比什麼舉動都有力的反擊，證明這場動亂不足為懼，我們不會被已經失敗過一次的叛徒擊潰。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "至於那些看不清現狀，選擇支持叛亂者的傢伙……我們只需要來年去他們的墓前，獻上一束百合花。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1"}, {"id": 184, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#7$1"}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "小心！", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#7$1"}, {"id": 186, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$bodyfalldown3", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_splashwine"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#7$1", "posfrom": "170,0", "posto": "145,0", "duration": 0.2}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#4$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "posfrom": "210,0", "posto": "30,0", "duration": 0.6, "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.1}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#4$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 1.0, "posfrom": "30,0", "posto": "10,0", "duration": 0.5, "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.6}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——抱歉——", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#4$1"}, {"id": 199, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 201, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……先不論這位好心小姐的裙子，您的莽撞可是糟蹋了一杯好酒，這位……不知名的先生。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#10$1"}}, {"id": 203, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "抱歉，真的非常抱歉！請原諒我的無禮，沃爾金娜公爵閣下——", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#10$1"}, {"id": 204, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 205, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您沒有冒犯到我，您現在更應當對這位被弄髒了裙子的小姐道歉。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#10$1"}, {"id": 206, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 207, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "呃，那這位……", "name": "？？？"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#4$1"}, {"id": 208, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 209, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒關係。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1"}, {"id": 210, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 211, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 212, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是誰讓這麼冒失的傢伙進來了？", "name": "擔憂的貴族"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "既然是侍者帶進來的，總不會是什麼籍籍無名的小市民。請問您的名字是？", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦！您可以叫我巴普洛維奇，下議院的一名小小議員，最近剛被陛下授予了樞密官身分，是卡托加區近期事務的特別全權代表——", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "卡托加區的代表？啊，我想起來了。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您竟然記得我，這還真是無上的榮幸！", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#6$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然，當然。我聽說議會遲遲沒有找到人選來處理卡托加區這個大麻煩，這份重任最後落在了您的身上，想必您一定有過人之處吧。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#6$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果不是我近來忙於為第二集團軍調度冬季物資，一定會親自派人上門祝賀。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#6$1"}, {"id": 223, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "公爵閣下實在是謬讚了……其實，我已經在卡托加區上任兩個月了。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}, {"id": 225, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也不知道自己究竟是何德何能，會被委以重任，但的確不敢讓陛下失望。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}, {"id": 227, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您應該知道的，卡托加區並不如大家所說的那樣一文不值，這個老工業區只是缺一個重新煥發生機的機會……", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（小聲）我怎麼沒聽說有這樣一號人物？", "name": "擔憂的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你在自己那座奢華的莊園裡休養了太久，不瞭解中樞人員變動也很正常。坐在花園搖椅裡百無聊賴的時候，至少多看看報紙吧。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，看了也只是徒增煩擾。", "name": "擔憂的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#2$1"}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不不……我實在不值得格利岑伯爵閣下費心——我聽說伯爵閣下的酒莊今年生意非常興盛，想必您應該十分繁忙……", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先不要急著獻殷勤——您是不是還欠這位小姐一個正式的道歉？", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這位熱心的小姐，請問您怎麼稱呼？", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "尊敬的公爵閣下，我叫娜塔莉婭·羅斯托娃。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "羅斯托娃？這個姓氏倒是沒怎麼聽說過……", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也沒有。", "name": "擔憂的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1"}, {"id": 243, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦！您的父親一定就是切爾諾伯格的安德烈伯爵吧。", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒想到您竟然會知道家父……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#6$1"}, {"id": 247, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "當然，您的父親是個有遠見的人，他及時從切城抽身而出，才不至於讓全副身家都丟在那裡——的確十分有智慧！", "name": "巴普洛維奇"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2158_1#1$1"}, {"id": 249, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#13$1"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……都已經是過去的事了。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#13$1"}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒想到，巴普洛維奇先生還真是……博聞強記。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#13$1"}, {"id": 253, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不過，還是先去換掉你的裙子吧，孩子。即使是再醇厚的美酒，也不是為了讓綢緞品嚐而釀造的。", "name": "驕傲的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#13$1"}, {"id": 254, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1"}}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好的，謝謝您……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#3$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 257, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_highheeledshoe_carpet_fts", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "posfrom": "0,0", "posto": "60,0", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 0.8, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 259, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早露匆匆離開了這個令自己窘迫的場合，隱約還能聽到身後人們熱切的談論。"}}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沃爾金娜公爵閣下！我聽說您不支持將卡托加區全面停用的提議，當然，我也一樣……", "name": "殷勤的聲音"}}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……這其中的產業，依然……", "name": "殷勤的聲音"}}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……也許我們能合作……", "name": "殷勤的聲音"}}, {"id": 264, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 265, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "72_g7_ballroom", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "style": "slider", "inverse": "true", "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$darkness02_intro", "key": "$darkness02_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……請注意你的措辭，梅利尼科夫先生。目前連陛下都還沒有對遠北事宜下定論。", "name": "嚴肅的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 276, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 277, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "大人，您誤會了我的意思，我剛才的話絕非是在對您或者女大公個人進行指責。", "name": "傲慢的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是，我早在葉莉薩維塔把遠北攪得烏煙瘴氣前，就已多次表達過對布列潔諾伊的擔憂，而你們當時卻齊聲向陛下保證她的忠誠。", "name": "傲慢的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以是你們，你們老一派的每個人，都辜負了議會與陛下的信任。", "name": "傲慢的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 280, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 281, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那就期盼你在聽證會上也能如此慷慨陳詞，最好一字不改，讓所有人知道，你如何妄言烏薩斯的基石們。", "name": "嚴肅的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 282, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 283, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不必等到那個時候，大人。", "name": "傲慢的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今晚皇帝陛下蒞臨會場，我一定會向他本人痛訴你們的罪行！", "name": "傲慢的貴族"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 287, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_walkfast"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.8}}, {"id": 289, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怒叱聲惹來了在場許多人的目光，幾位侍從趕忙上前，試圖平息大人物不知因何而起的怒火。"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早露拉緊衣袖，驅散些許寒意，儘管舞會廳的壁爐比烏薩斯任何一處都燒得更熱，暖氣也終日供應著。"}}, {"id": 293, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一旁的侍從正在更換香氛，濃郁的佛手柑與橙花的氣味，遮掩住酒精揮發的辛辣，早露長嘆一口氣。"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#4$1"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 298, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔申卡，你還好嗎？還是沒有找到適合聊天的人選？", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 302, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦天啊，你的裙子——是誰這麼沒禮貌？把那個人的名字告訴我，我一定狠狠教訓他一頓！", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 303, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不是的，夫人，您實在不必為此生氣。這是我幫助了一位女士所留下的“勛章”呢。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#8$1"}, {"id": 305, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 306, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你是個熱心的孩子，但答應我，下次先保證自己的安全，好嗎？誰知道那些諂媚的傢伙會做出什麼事。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 307, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 308, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "感謝您的關心，但這算得上是今晚頭等有趣的好事了。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1"}, {"id": 309, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#12$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 310, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今晚我所聽到的大都與那位女大公有關。我試著去瞭解，去詢問，卻始終因為對這類話題缺乏必要的知識，導致對話無法進行下去。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#12$1"}, {"id": 311, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 312, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這就是你父母讓你來到聖駿堡的作用了，我親愛的娜塔申卡。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 313, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我見過許多年輕的小姐，寧可把靈魂託付給廚師、裁縫和醫生，也不願分神給那些制定法律、平定叛亂、敲定賦稅的偉人……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 314, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "即使是他們始終在照看著我們。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 315, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#5$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 316, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "您說的道理我都明白，但我如今只是一個中部小伯爵的繼承人，又怎麼會得到這些人在百忙之中才會抽出空來的注視呢？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#5$1"}, {"id": 317, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 318, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……你是我的老朋友的獨生女，我必須得把話講得更明白。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 319, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒有人能脫離政治而生存，尤其你承襲了貴族的頭銜，它已經賦予了你沉重的責任。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 320, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#14$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 321, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "這樣的責任，是藉由在這裡輕鬆地談論一些事物就能實現的嗎……", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#14$1"}, {"id": 322, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 323, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "娜塔申卡……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 324, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你誤解了我們在這裡高談闊論的緣由。這些話語並不是為了宣告一定會被落實的舉措，也不是為了表明我們真正的意見。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 325, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#10$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 326, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那是為了……什麼呢？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#10$1"}, {"id": 327, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 328, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "為了合群，孩子。為了迅速與一些人劃清界限，又與另一些人結為同盟。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 329, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "一份簽名文件，或許就能讓你的父母東山再起，讓你的兒女遠離戰壕，讓你的朋友都在莊園裡安穩入眠。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 330, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要以為沉浸享樂就能逃離他們的目光，這只會讓他們照看你的方式變得粗暴，且不容置疑。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 331, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真正有效的社交場合就是這樣運作的，我的娜塔申卡。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 332, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 333, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……看來我要學習的還有很多。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1"}, {"id": 334, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 335, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所幸，年輕人最不缺的就是時間了。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 336, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 337, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 338, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 339, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 340, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 341, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 342, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（低聲）是議長閣下——", "name": "貴族A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 343, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 344, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "還有瓦西里副議長！真稀奇，他們幾乎不會一同出現在議會之外的地方……", "name": "貴族B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 345, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 346, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "議長閣下很少參加舞會，但陛下還遲遲沒有駕臨……這，是否是某種訊號？", "name": "貴族A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 347, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 348, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也許是想安撫我們。", "name": "貴族B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 349, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 350, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那恐怕來得有點晚了。", "name": "貴族A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 351, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 352, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 353, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 354, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}}, {"id": 355, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 356, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#6$1"}}, {"id": 357, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那兩位……？", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#6$1"}, {"id": 358, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 359, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 360, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 361, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 362, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_1984_1#1$1", "duration": 1.5}}, {"id": 363, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crowdtalk_fear", "loop": "true", "channel": "a", "volume": 0.0}}, {"id": 364, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 1.0, "channel": "a", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 365, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 366, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 367, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "在兩人到來的第一時間，整個舞會的目光都聚集在了他們身上。人們自動為兩人的到來分出一條道路，通向舞會廳的正中央。"}}, {"id": 368, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "人群中發出聲音響亮但不知情緒真假的問候。"}}, {"id": 369, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 370, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 371, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1", "style": "bg", "name": "bg_black", "afrom": 0.0, "ato": 0.6, "duration": 2.0, "slot": "bgover", "layer": 1.0, "isblock": "true"}}, {"id": 372, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 373, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2172_1#1$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.7, "duration": 1.0, "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 374, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.7, "duration": 1.0, "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 375, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 376, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“我們敬愛的議長閣下，向您致敬。”", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "multi": "true", "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 377, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 378, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 379, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 380, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2169_1#1$1", "bstart": 0.2, "bend": 0.7, "duration": 1.0, "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 381, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "“尊敬的副議長閣下，祝您身體健康。”", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "multi": "true", "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 382, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 383, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 384, "prop": "Subtitle", "attributes": {"text": "……", "x": 300.0, "y": 350.0, "alignment": "center", "size": 24.0, "delay": 0.04, "width": 700.0}}, {"id": 385, "prop": "subtitle", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 386, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1", "style": "bg", "name": "bg_black", "afrom": 0.6, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.0, "slot": "bgover", "layer": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 387, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 388, "prop": "avgdisplay", "attributes": {"id": "1"}}, {"id": 389, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#10$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 390, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 391, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "focus": "n"}}, {"id": 392, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.5, "channel": "a", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 393, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "早露擠在人群中，小心地觀察兩人。"}}, {"id": 394, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 395, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 396, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 397, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1984_1#1$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 398, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.8}}, {"id": 399, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1984_1#1$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 400, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 401, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "黑髮的男人沉默地從人群中走過，臉上不見喜怒，眼神堅定卻難掩疲憊，只是看向空無一物的前方。"}}, {"id": 402, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 403, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 404, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_woodfloor_fts", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 405, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 406, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.8}}, {"id": 407, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2162_1#2$1", "afrom": 1.0, "ato": 0.0, "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 408, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 409, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "被稱為“副議長”的男人走在明顯矮他一頭的黑髮男人身後，恭敬地維持著半個身位的距離，同時以溫和的笑容向人們點頭致意。"}}, {"id": 410, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 411, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 412, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "a", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 413, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 414, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 415, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……金髮的那位，是瓦西里·戈爾奇科夫公爵 、近衛軍榮譽上將，也是帝國議會的常務副議長。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 416, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "（低聲）而走在他前面，黑髮的那位——", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 417, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 418, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "伊斯拉姆·維特議長。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1"}, {"id": 419, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 420, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "沒錯……每個立足在聖駿堡的人都不該不認識他。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 421, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#2$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 422, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，夫人，是我在城際網路上看過他演講的影片。《在圖利斯卡亞特別技術學校落成儀式上的演說》，內容簡潔真摯，令人印象深刻。", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#2$1"}, {"id": 423, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 424, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，城際網路……我可能永遠也搞不懂這些時髦的玩意。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 425, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "去吧，娜塔申卡，去他們的身邊。去聽聽那些人都在說些什麼，這也是學習的好時機。", "name": "沃倫佐娃夫人"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2173_1#1$1"}, {"id": 426, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 427, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好的，夫人。那麼，我現在就——", "name": "早露"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2165_1#1$1"}, {"id": 428, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 429, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 430, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 431, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_phntsmglsbrek", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 432, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 433, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside", "volume": 0.0, "channel": "f", "loop": "true"}}, {"id": 434, "prop": "SoundVolume", "attributes": {"volume": 0.8, "channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 435, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "清脆的玻璃破碎聲響，在舞會廳各處愉悅的高談闊論中顯得如此刺耳，人們不禁尋找它的源頭。"}}, {"id": 436, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 437, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 438, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "奧薩奇伯爵，您的身體有什麼不適嗎？", "name": "貴族A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 439, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 440, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……不，不不，是他們來了，他們在樓下！", "name": "貴族B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 441, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_spotlightc", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 442, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 443, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.1, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 444, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_paniccrowd", "volume": 0.7}}, {"id": 445, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "什麼？哪個混蛋把電源總開關關了——難道是停電了？", "name": "貴族A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 446, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不，皇宮怎麼會突然停電？肯定是暴民——", "name": "貴族B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 447, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 448, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 449, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_recorderglitch", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 450, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.5, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 451, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 452, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.5, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 453, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 454, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.8, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 455, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 3.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 456, "prop": "StopSound", "attributes": {"channel": "f", "fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 457, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "r", "name": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 458, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "name": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1", "focus": "r"}}, {"id": 459, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "皇宮的勤務官就是這麼辦事的嗎，連個電源總開關都維護不好——", "name": "貴族A"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1981_1#1$1"}, {"id": 460, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "l", "focus": "l"}}, {"id": 461, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……快點看外面！", "name": "貴族B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 462, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "真的有暴民，還在我們的窗外！", "name": "貴族B"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2171_1#1$1"}, {"id": 463, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 464, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 465, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 466, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 467, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 468, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 469, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 470, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": ""}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}